title: Chimney
text: Drag the REFLECTOR from the toolbox onto the board, and click it to turn it. A reflector is a mirror: it bounces the beam off at a right angle. Send the beam up the chimney to light the pinwheel.
trick: one reflector turns the beam onto the target
motif: stove pipe and chimney
---
